{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17323260","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17323260","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1732326001:1":{"text":"没错，那些失踪的老爷们回来后都在说，这次全靠罗兰大帝庇佑。","source_cn":"没错，那些失踪的老爷们回来后都在说，这次全靠罗兰大帝庇佑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FCBE2EB4D85024F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1732326002:1":{"text":"可是圣古堂怎么会有恶魔呢？难道这也是王后阴谋中的一环？","source_cn":"可是圣古堂怎么会有恶魔呢？难道这也是王后阴谋中的一环？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2F386EB155C452A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1732326003:1":{"text":"那些恶魔呢？他们是被显灵的罗兰大帝消灭还是逃跑了？","source_cn":"那些恶魔呢？他们是被显灵的罗兰大帝消灭还是逃跑了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1ED3999E96E5A03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1732326004:1":{"text":"你说会不会有恶魔藏在附近的某个角落吧？","source_cn":"你说会不会有恶魔藏在附近的某个角落吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2773E20369BD5D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商贩博斯坦":{"text":"商贩博斯坦","source":"商贩博斯坦","status":"source"},"speaker:工人米特":{"text":"工人米特","source":"工人米特","status":"source"},"speaker:工人卡尔特":{"text":"工人卡尔特","source":"工人卡尔特","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}}